{"id":"631663","name":"洋葱肉丝卷饼","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631663/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"60克"},{"name":"冷水","amount":"60克"},{"name":"洋葱炒肉丝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"13香","amount":"适量"},{"name":"熟油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"提前做好的洋葱炒肉丝。","img":"images/631663/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"一半开水、一半冷水把面和好，松弛20分钟。","img":"images/631663/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"面粉、13香、熟玉米油、盐调成一个油酥。","img":"images/631663/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"面团不要揉面，直接整理成长条，分成均匀的剂子。","img":"images/631663/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"按扁。","img":"images/631663/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一面抹上油酥。","img":"images/631663/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"来一个盖在上面，擀薄。","img":"images/631663/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面饼放入平底锅，小火慢慢烙。","img":"images/631663/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烙至鼓起来反面。","img":"images/631663/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"熟透出锅，中间分开。","img":"images/631663/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放上洋葱炒肉丝。","img":"images/631663/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"卷起来就好了。","img":"images/631663/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好吃又美味。","img":"images/631663/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}